# A Barrows run on the trip plaque: the trip starts on arriving at the mounds, the brothers killed
# come from the game's varbits, the crypt with the tunnel is marked when the game asks about it,
# and the chest is logged from its reward with the chest count, then the next run starts afresh.
# Schematic, not the real map: the mounds are in region 14131 and the crypts and tunnels in region
# 14231 (RuneLite's Barrows plugin: BARROWS_REGION_ID, CRYPT_REGION_ID), so the scenes only sit in
# those regions. Facts: the brothers' varbits are VarbitID.BARROWS_KILLED_*, and the levels killed
# are VarbitID.BARROWS_KILLED_MONSTER (RuneLite's older Varbits calls it BARROWS_REWARD_POTENTIAL);
# Ahrim the Blighted and Karil the Tainted are combat level 98, the other four 115
# (oldschool.runescape.wiki, each brother's page); "reward potential ... capped at 1000 ... The
# number of brothers killed times two is then added" (Chest (Barrows)); the game's prompt says
# "You've found a hidden tunnel" (Update:Poll 75 Game Improvements Blog). The chest count message
# is the form core/Chat reads.
scene 3520 3264
skill ATTACK 75
skill STRENGTH 75
skill DEFENCE 75
skill HITPOINTS 75
skill MAGIC 75
skill PRAYER 52
item SPADE "Spade"
item SHARK "Shark"
item _4DOSEPRAYERRESTORE "Prayer potion(4)"
item BARROWS_AHRIM_HEAD "Ahrim's hood" price 60000
item BLOODRUNE "Blood rune" price 400
items INV SPADE 1
items INV SHARK 6
items INV _4DOSEPRAYERRESTORE 4
at 3551 3290
login
config barrowsAim BLOOD_RUNES
watch over tripPlaque.shown.over
watch title tripPlaque.shown.title
watch line0 tripPlaque.shown.lines.0.text
watch line1 tripPlaque.shown.lines.1.text
watch right1 tripPlaque.shown.lines.1.right
watch line2 tripPlaque.shown.lines.2.text
watch line3 tripPlaque.shown.lines.3.text
tick 2
expect over = "BOSS PILOT: ON A TRIP"
expect title = Barrows
expect line0 ~ "0 chests in"
expect line1 = "No brothers killed yet this run"
expect line2 = "Tunnel not found yet this run"
expect line3 ~ "For blood runes: "

# Ahrim down: 98 levels, and two for the brother.
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_AHRIM 1
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_MONSTER 98
tick 2
expect line1 = "1 of 6 down: Ahrim"
expect right1 = "potential 100"

# Down in Guthan's crypt, the game asks about the hidden tunnel.
scene 3520 9664 3
at 3552 9700 3
object BARROWS_STAIRS_GUTHAN 3550 9703
object BARROW_GUTHAN_SARCOPHAGUS 3553 9702
object BARROWS_STAIRS_AHRIM 3580 9720
widget Messagebox.TEXT text "You've found a hidden tunnel, do you want to enter?"
tick 2
expect line2 = "Tunnel: Guthan's crypt, go there last"
expect saved.barrowsTunnel = GUTHAN
close Messagebox.TEXT

# The other five, a skeleton and two giant crypt spiders: 656 + 77 + 158 levels, 891 + 12 = 903.
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_DHAROK 1
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_GUTHAN 1
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_KARIL 1
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_TORAG 1
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_VERAC 1
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_MONSTER 891
tick 2
expect line1 = "All six brothers down"
expect right1 = "potential 903"
expect line3 = "Past 880 for blood runes: no more tunnel kills"

# The chest: its count, then its reward. The game clears the run.
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Your Barrows chest count is: 41."
items TRAIL_REWARDINV BARROWS_AHRIM_HEAD 1
items TRAIL_REWARDINV BLOODRUNE 200 stacked
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_AHRIM 0
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_DHAROK 0
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_GUTHAN 0
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_KARIL 0
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_TORAG 0
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_VERAC 0
varbit BARROWS_KILLED_MONSTER 0
tick 2
expect line0 ~ "1 chest in"
expect line0 !~ "kill"
expect saved.barrowsV1 ~ hood          # the piece, logged
expect saved.barrowsV1 ~ :903,         # the potential the chest was opened at
expect saved.barrowsV1 ~ :140000,      # its worth: the hood and 200 blood runes
expect saved.barrowsTunnel = -
expect line1 = "No brothers killed yet this run"
expect line2 = "Tunnel not found yet this run"
